        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05_001:a2702178",
        "jp_sha256": "be277a1909ed4f91a3514119de649425c6433c164d2336050e16107a14eebac3",
        "official_en_sha256": "dec072eeee728bc66284b466e7409ee64c763c8b4e1e5aea027f8341f6ef7eed"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この「鉄道」ってのは面白い乗り物だな。\r\nオレがいた世界にはなかったぜ。",
        "official_en": "These “trains” are an interesting little contraption. The realm from which I hail did not have such conveyances.",
        "real_en": "These 'trains' are interesting vehicles. We didn't have anything like them in my world."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
