    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05_007:42d2a503",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05",
        "key": "SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05_007:42d2a503",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_05_007:42d2a503",
        "jp_sha256": "dbbfabba7c71f45c6250571f13a2c64cfeda21e5a05b5809f9f8cfd8e19a06fc",
        "official_en_sha256": "0908d3fba604c0d66ac181abeafc182670a7e5f6f8339c689924f696dc5cf87b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何を隠そうこのオレも、初めて鉄道に乗ったとき\r\nつい大騒ぎしたせいで、車掌さんに叱られたのだ！",
        "official_en": "I will have you know that when I first boarded this contraption, a man with a funny hat named Conductor harangued me for getting too excited!",
        "real_en": "I’ll have you know, when I first rode a train,\r\nthe conductor scolded me for making such a fuss!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
